icity and sperm quality Pregnancy length and litter size Histopathology and weight of reproductive and non-reproductive organs Haematology and clinical chemistry Offspring (F1): Growth, survival and sexual maturation Histopathology and weight of reproductive and non-reproductive organs (Cohort 1A) Weight of reproductive organs and optional histopathology (Cohort 1B) Haematology and clinical chemistry", "metadata": {"doc_id": "cd477890-65f1-40ad-8e10-8f6e239c64f7", "content_type": "Table", "filename": "information_requirements_r7a_en_part_4.pdf"}}